code: 0
--- stdout
The issue moves to another stage

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  --milestone
  Batch:     gh dojo plan 12 13 14: each issue on its own, a failed one skipped;
             exit code 5 when some were written: a re-run finishes the rest
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Milestone: the open milestone --milestone names, by title or a start only its title has;
             an issue in it already keeps it, so a repeat is safe
             no such milestone, or several, is exit code 1, with the open ones or the candidates;
             --milestone none takes the issue out of its milestone
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               Moved to {milestone}.

Usage:
  gh dojo plan <N>... [flags]

Flags:
      --comments N|all    how many of the latest comments the card prints, or all (up to 100); implies --show (default 5)
      --dry-run           print the plan without changing anything
      --full              print the card's description and comments without cutting them; implies --show
  -h, --help              help for plan
      --milestone title   the open milestone to set, by title or a start only its title has; none takes the issue out of its milestone
      --show              also print the issue's card, as gh dojo show N does, from the same read

Global flags: --jq, --json, --template (see gh dojo --help)
--- stderr
